      "Keep cleanliness and handling in the same document. Specify cleaning solvent, bakeout preparation, gloves, packaging and the time between cleaning and pump-down. The qualification is only useful if production can repeat the preparation. A clean test sample with a different cable or adhesive does not qualify the delivered assembly.",
