      "Keep pressure, temperature, RGA, reference readings, encoder diagnostics and motion commands in one record. If a failure appears, the team can tell whether it follows a gas event, a thermal step, a cable movement or a mechanical shift. This evidence is more valuable to procurement than a generic vacuum badge because it describes the delivered system.",
